#: index.md:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "InstUI, everywhere"
msgstr "InstUI，無所不在"

#: index.md:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "One resolved token model, reshaped into stylesheets, framework bindings, native code, and design-tool payloads."
msgstr "一個解析後的代幣模型，轉換成樣式表、框架綁定、原生程式碼與設計工具的載入資料。"

#: index.md:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "開始使用"

#: index.md:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "The package map"
msgstr "套件地圖"

#: index.md:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "API 參考"

#: index.md:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "CSS reference"
msgstr "CSS 參考"

#: index.md:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "One source of truth"
msgstr "單一真實來源"

#: index.md:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "Every package reads the same resolved token IR. Change a token upstream and it flows to CSS, SCSS, native code, and Figma the same way."
msgstr "每個套件都讀取相同的解析後代幣中介表示（IR）。在上游變更代幣，會以相同方式流到 CSS、SCSS、原生程式碼與 Figma。"

#: index.md:29
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the smallest package"
msgstr "使用最小的套件"

#: index.md:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Install just @pantoken/css for a stylesheet, @pantoken/react for hooks and icons, or a bundler preset for Tailwind, Panda, or MUI."
msgstr "只需安裝 @pantoken/css 取得樣式表、安裝 @pantoken/react 取得 hooks 與圖示，或安裝 Tailwind、Panda 或 MUI 的打包器預設。"

#: index.md:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generate for any platform"
msgstr "為任何平台生成"

#: index.md:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "Run `pantoken generate` to emit Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress, and more. The same tokens, in each ecosystem's idiom."
msgstr "執行 `pantoken generate` 可輸出 Swift、Kotlin、Compose、Flutter、Rust、WordPress 等。相同的代幣，以各生態系慣用語表達。"

#: index.md:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "No upstream coupling"
msgstr "不與上游耦合"

#: index.md:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "The tokens ship vendored as static JSON, so `npm i` never reaches for a GitHub-only source. Publishable, semver'd, offline-friendly."
msgstr "代幣以內嵌（vendored）靜態 JSON 發佈，因此 `npm i` 不會去取用僅在 GitHub 的來源。可發佈、使用 semver，且支援離線。"
